# ---- own-account projects (BH-1657) -----------------------------------------
# A project pinned to its own Claude account runs every claude call on that
# account's token (<env dir>/accounts.d/<label>.env) and never on the shared
# project-6/max accounts. The pin is DATA: the settings row account.<project>
# (value = the label, or `shared` to unpin), set from Mission Control
# /settings → PROJECT ACCOUNTS. This variable is only the FALLBACK a box reads
# when it gets no settings answer at all. Leave it unset unless a box has to
# run with the worker down; there is no default.
# Format: comma-separated project=label pairs.
#ACCOUNT_OWN_PROJECTS=
